data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhere <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"30\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is an integral constant.</p>\n</div></div>",
